enemies.barracuda.group.min,3,1,30,"NOT a school - the two aggressive species that arrive as a pack. Weight alone cannot move the mix while every hunter spawns one at a time against schools of a dozen, so these two are the counterweight to the rows above and are deliberately left where they were when the schools were cut."
